{
  "version": 5,
  "note": "Tier-2 breadth. Nine surfaces covering the web-and-marketing, social-and-syndication and email slices; twenty-one styles taking the catalog from the Tier-1 floor to the Tier-2 showcase; one subject correction. Every treatment image-tools implements now appears in at least one style, every strategy has at least two, and every declared placement is claimed by at least one style.",
  "retune_reasons": [
    "swiss-contour moves from subject `geological` to `cartographic` and from the terrain generator to the new `contour` one. It was named for contour lines and drew a mountain under a line screen, which is a picture of terrain wearing stripes rather than a map. A generator that draws level sets of a height field now exists, and the style that carries the word in its name should be the one that uses it.",
    "The `procedural` strategy gains its first styles. It had none, so the Tier-1 rule 'at least two styles per strategy' was unmet from the day the catalog was written. The five that fill it are the mesh gradients and the nebulae — art directions that are finished when the generator finishes, and that a screen would spoil rather than improve.",
    "curve, defocus, motion_blur and pixel_sort had landed operations and no style. A treatment nobody can see in the catalog is invisible to every operator, which is the same defect as an axis value with nothing behind it. terrazzo-truchet, filament-plot, long-exposure-flow and molten-terrain exist to close that gap and were art-directed to suit the operation rather than to tick it.",
    "Six placements — device_center, the three caption variants, feature_graphic and type_mask — were in the vocabulary and claimed by no style, so the store and syndication lanes were untested in practice. Five styles now claim them, each composed with a quiet centre or a quiet band where the chrome goes.",
    "The model-backed slice is smaller than the Tier-2 shape table asks for (six styles against a suggested ten to twelve). That is deliberate: local generation runs out of device memory at hero aspect on the reference host, so every additional guided style is a row nobody can validate. The shortfall is recorded in docs/evidence/catalog/coverage.md rather than hidden by padding the count."
  ],
